    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even just 'detachment'. it's like i saw what real life is. what actually matters. and now i'm back here in this... this playground. it feels like i'm a different species. i don't see the point in pretending to care about these trivial things anymore. it feels more honest to just admit that i don't belong in this version of reality.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
